:"vndb:vn-staff:143557","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ひなづか 凉","creatorId":"vndb:s6786","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6786","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6786","name":"ひなづか 凉","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:143558","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"みつばちらびっと","creatorId":"vndb:s14970","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14970","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14970","name":"みつばちらびっと","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:143562","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c65170","characterName":"氷川 瞳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59417","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"230988"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17532"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65170"},"originalCharacterName":"氷川 瞳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger daughter of the famous wrestler, Falcon Yamagata, she has been searching for her missing elder sister for three years when she gets wind of the illegal underground \"DATEN\" tournament. She participates hoping to find and bring her elder sister back to her surviving family."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Assuming Hitomi wins all of her bouts,"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Case 1: If you select the option of telling her to cheat/foul in all matches: She succeeds in defeating her elder sister Kaoru and becomes the new champion. She becomes addicted to the thrill of fighting and winning in a no-holds-barred mixed wrestling match and stays behind to help Kazuki and Kaoru escape."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Case 2: If you select the option of not cheating/fouling before her match: After winning against Kaoru, she alongside Kazuki and Kaoru escape from the island. In order to escape from the pursuers, Kazuki suggests them to become celebrities so the pursuers can't do anything to them. Hitomi offers Kaoru to be part of tag team in TV wrestling show and Kazuki to become her trainer."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65170"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とともに地下格闘技場の「見世物ファイター」として【DATEN】に潜入する女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公加藤とは、過去に同じ学園の体育学部に通う生徒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子プロレスリングの花形選手だった姉の影響で自分もレスリングを始めたが、すぐにやめてしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は何もしてないとはいえ天性のセンスがあり、素人とは比べものにならないほどの力があるが、プロには劣る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17532","sourceWorkId":"25825","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とともに地下格闘技場の「見世物ファイター」として【DATEN】に潜入する女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公加藤とは、過去に同じ学園の体育学部に通う生徒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子プロレスリングの花形選手だった姉の影響で自分もレスリングを始めたが、すぐにやめてしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は何もしてないとはいえ天性のセンスがあり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素人とは比べものにならないほどの力があるが、プロには劣る。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59417"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f985b82fd42688230bd02b51597866e940fef157a15fcf9cf564160adf89325a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae7b5f980a80bb8573734072fd5e46ac13fd51ab183ceda40f82b0450497641e.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長瀬ゆずは","creatorId":"vndb:s2287","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2287","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2287","name":"長瀬ゆずは","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:230988:59417:24238:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65171","characterName":"ネメシス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["17533"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65171"},"originalCharacterName":"ネメシス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hitomi's older sister. She runs away after her mother is hospitalised and participates in the DATEN tournament. For three years she is the undisputed champion and is also in charge of the live commentary for matches she is not involved in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"More talented than her younger sister in wrestling, she used to bully Hitomi when they sparred as children (to the point Hitomi would have her arm broken and urinate involuntarily under a choke hold)."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Despite her sadism and apparent cruelty to Hitomi, the truth is she ran away to help support her remaining family through her income from bouts or successful bets behind the back of the DATEN organisers."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Case 1: If you select the option of telling Hitomi to cheat/foul in all her matches: When she successfully escapes the DATEN island together with Kazuki, she trains him in wrestling techniques so that he can return to support Hitomi. Because she lost to Hitomi, she is no longer eligible to return to the DATEN tournament and still misses the thrill of fighting on stage there."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Case 2: If you select the option of not cheating/fouling before Hitomi's matches: She escapes alongside Hitomi and Kazuki. She is offered to be part of a tag team in TV wrestling shows by Hitomi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65171"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"瞳の前に立ちはだかるグラマラスな女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その正体は瞳の姉、ＤＡＴＥＮの実況として参加している様だが、その本心は……？"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17533","sourceWorkId":"25825","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5e52c5a7074e75e952189eea917d958857ae19039d7bb5a2408b8c53117f502.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a62fa0170378540ae800bfea6080e375bbf6e167ec919fcaf1376ce49f2b15e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"櫻井 ありす","creatorId":"vndb:s1626","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1626","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1626","name":"櫻井 ありす","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:75529","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65645","characterName":"加藤 一樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65645"},"originalCharacterName":"加藤 一樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hitomi's partner in the DATEN tournament. In return for helping Hitomi win the tournament with his advice and training, she's willing to give him the three million yen prize money because her main objective is to find her missing older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A big fan of the famous wrestler Falcon Yamagata, he initially aimed to emulate his idol as a professional wrestler but discovered he wasn't talented enough to succeed in wrestling. His switch to being a personal trainer was in the hopes of supporting wrestlers like Falcon Yamagata."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is very knowledgeable of the wrestling word and its personalities and is capable of recognising the masked wrestlers in the DATEN tournament based on their physical attributes and techniques alone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65645"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1058","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2836","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1058","name":"ARMADILLO","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:25825:2836","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1058","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1058","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1058","name":"Armadillo","ro